WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.757
The learning outcomes explain what you will practise In

00:00:02.849 --> 00:00:05.757
this learning unit you will prepare a clear working

00:00:05.771 --> 00:00:10.021
agreement and a reasoned decision brief The outcomes below

00:00:10.086 --> 00:00:13.139
describe the capabilities that the teaching and practice will

00:00:13.152 --> 00:00:17.060
help you develop Your practice drafts are not evidence

00:00:17.099 --> 00:00:19.876
of formal competence until they have been reviewed through

00:00:19.942 --> 00:00:24.073
the authorised assessment process What will be expected of

00:00:24.099 --> 00:00:26.942
you in this LU In this learning activity you

00:00:26.968 --> 00:00:29.928
will distinguish what was known at 07:40 from later

00:00:29.981 --> 00:00:35.284
decisions accepted work and closure evidence Outcomes linked to

00:00:35.336 --> 00:00:40.152
this activity EA-01 . 1 Translate an executive brief

00:00:40.192 --> 00:00:46.823
into agreed support priorities deliverables and review points EA-01

00:00:46.889 --> 00:00:50.547
. 3 Distinguish EA responsibilities from those of a

00:00:50.626 --> 00:00:55.021
personal assistant office manager chief of staff and specialist

00:00:55.047 --> 00:01:00.652
adviser and refer work outside the agreed mandate EA-01

00:01:00.718 --> 00:01:04.928
. 4 Present options and consequences when demands compete

00:01:05.323 --> 00:01:10.376
including effects on preparation time cost wellbeing and required

00:01:10.442 --> 00:01:16.047
protective decisions EA-01 . 5 Agree a safe route

00:01:16.126 --> 00:01:20.823
for raising concerns resolving expectations and arranging an authorised

00:01:20.889 --> 00:01:24.915
deputy without making the role dependent on permanent availability

00:01:25.848 --> 00:01:29.177
Learning practice and acknowledgement are not an assessor result

00:01:29.282 --> 00:01:30.914
or workplace authorisation
